{"id": "r06_35", "text": "Put the blue triangles and blue cylinders on the right, the blue cubes in the middle, and all red and yellow objects on the left.", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": "left", "red/triangle": "left", "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "left", "yellow/triangle": "left", "blue/cube": "center", "blue/cylinder": "right", "blue/triangle": "right"}, "category": "shape", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r06_36", "text": "Cubes go into the right bin, whatever their colour. Everything that isn't a cube is sorted by colour: red left, yellow middle, blue left.", "gt": {"red/cube": "right", "red/cylinder": "left", "red/triangle": "left", "yellow/cube": "right", "yellow/cylinder": "center", "yellow/triangle": "center", "blue/cube": "right", "blue/cylinder": "left", "blue/triangle": "left"}, "category": "shape", "adversarial": false}
