{"id": "r06_40", "text": "Sort by colour: red left, yellow center, blue right. The one exception: triangles of any colour go in the left bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": "left", "red/triangle": "left", "yellow/cube": "center", "yellow/cylinder": "center", "yellow/triangle": "left", "blue/cube": "right", "blue/cylinder": "right", "blue/triangle": "left"}, "category": "shape", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r06_41", "text": "Put the cylinders in the middle bin. The cubes and triangles go by colour: red ones on the right, yellow and blue ones on the left.", "gt": {"red/cube": "right", "red/cylinder": "center", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "center", "yellow/triangle": "left", "blue/cube": "left", "blue/cylinder": "center", "blue/triangle": "left"}, "category": "shape", "adversarial": false}
