{"id": "r06_48", "text": "Sort red to the right and yellow to the left, but keep the yellow triangles on the counter.", "gt": {"red/cube": "right", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "left", "yellow/triangle": null, "blue/cube": null, "blue/cylinder": null, "blue/triangle": null}, "category": "counter", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r06_49", "text": "Everything goes in the left bin except the blue objects, which should stay on the counter.", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": "left", "red/triangle": "left", "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "left", "yellow/triangle": "left", "blue/cube": null, "blue/cylinder": null, "blue/triangle": null}, "category": "counter", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r06_50", "text": "Move the red and blue cubes into the middle bin; all other objects remain on the counter.", "gt": {"red/cube": "center", "red/cylinder": null, "red/triangle": null, "yellow/cube": null, "yellow/cylinder": null, "yellow/triangle": null, "blue/cube": "center", "blue/cylinder": null, "blue/triangle": null}, "category": "counter", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r06_51", "text": "Q: Where do the reds go? A: The right bin. Q: And the blues? A: Same bin as the reds. Q: What about yellow? A: Leave those on the counter.", "gt": {"red/cube": "right", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": null, "yellow/cylinder": null, "yellow/triangle": null, "blue/cube": "right", "blue/cylinder": "right", "blue/triangle": "right"}, "category": "adv_dialogue", "adversarial": true}
{"id": "r06_52", "text": "To the left bin with the yellows! The blues? Middle. And the reds, straight into the one on the right.", "gt": {"red/cube": "right", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "left", "yellow/triangle": "left", "blue/cube": "center", "blue/cylinder": "center", "blue/triangle": "center"}, "category": "adv_fronted", "adversarial": true}
{"id": "r06_53", "text": "First, the yellow ones: right bin. Second, the red ones: left bin. Third, the blue ones: center bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": "left", "red/triangle": "left", "yellow/cube": "right", "yellow/cylinder": "right", "yellow/triangle": "right", "blue/cube": "center", "blue/cylinder": "center", "blue/triangle": "center"}, "category": "adv_step_ordinals", "adversarial": true}
